[Common Keys]
;
; mpv.jkm -- keys for the mpv scripts.
;
; ONE KEY, AND IT IS NOT A NEW ONE. JAWSKey+H is hot key help everywhere in
; JAWS, so nothing has to be learned and nothing of mpv's own is taken -- every
; mpv command is a plain letter or an arrow with no JAWS key in front of it.
;
; The commands themselves are reached from the view rather than from keys, which
; is the point: a person can find them without knowing they exist.
;
HotKeyHelp=INSERT+H
